====================================================================
IBSI digital phantom and reference values
====================================================================
Files under packages/compliance/ibsi-2d/ and reproductions/p1-ibsi-2d/
contain the IBSI 1 digital phantom, mask, slice images and 2D reference
values derived from the Image Biomarker Standardization Initiative.

License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
Source: https://github.com/theibsi/data_sets (commit 6da9602...)
Reference manual: IBSI reference manual v10, Chapter 3

Please cite:
Zwanenburg A, Vallieres M, Abdalah MA, et al. The Image Biomarker
Standardization Initiative: Standardized Quantitative Radiomics for
High-Throughput Image-based Phenotyping. Radiology. 2020;295(2):328-338.
doi:10.1148/radiol.2020191145

